     "description": "<ul><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Joint research on several projects, including federated learning, knowledge distillation, and trustworthy AI, with access to the institute's high-performance computing resources.</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Several joint journal publications in Q1/Q2 journals, including Knowledge-Based Systems (2026, IF:8); International Journal of Information Security (2026, IF:5.0); and IEEE ACCESS (2026, IF:4.2). Some of the papers are under review in several journals and conferences.</p></li></ul>",
